      "answerTypeCustomizations": {
        "buildJavaScript": "Follow these rules when generating code:\n- Update the existing selectGig function so it accepts one parameter for the gig name.\n- Update the three button event listeners so each one calls selectGig with the correct gig name as an argument.\n- Do not add additional parameters beyond what the student planned in prompt.md.\n- Do not add loops, arrays, or conditional logic.\n- Keep the code structure and style consistent with what already exists in the file.\n- Do not modify any HTML or CSS.\n- Do not add new functions beyond updating selectGig."
      }
