    "bubble_choice_description": "Use AI to build a function that updates the app when a job is selected. Test different inputs and see how the output changes.",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nThe Earnr app lets users pick a food delivery gig and see their projected earnings update. Right now, the function that updates the gig display ignores which gig was clicked — it always shows the same thing. Use AI to add a parameter so the display shows the correct gig.\r\n\r\nPlan in `spec.md`, then prompt the AI with your plan to update the function. Test by clicking different gigs.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/36df340675efd7016d812cb2d4d89a18-hero.jpg"
  },
